  "prefLabel": "Plu 302.07 Effect of Signature on Application for License as a Plumbing Business",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 302.07 Effect of Signature on Application for License as a Plumbing Business. The effect of the signature required by Plu 302.06(c) is to make breach of the applicant’s promise to perform its work in accordance with the state plumbing code or any more stringent local code misconduct pursuant to RSA 329-A:12, II(c).\n\nSource. #8542, eff 1-20-06; ss by#8981, eff 9-20-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plu100-500.html"
